	<div id="long" class="long">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the wizard quietly brews a potion of vexing jumbled flasks. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs, then sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow. A wavy Tokyo yacht ran away to Taffy Vault at a VAT office, where AVATAR wave typography was tested by careful readers. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the wizard quietly brews a potion of vexing jumbled flasks. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs, then sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow. A wavy Tokyo yacht ran away to Taffy Vault at a VAT office, where AVATAR wave typography was tested by careful readers. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the wizard quietly brews a potion of vexing jumbled flasks. Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs, then sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow. A wavy Tokyo yacht ran away to Taffy Vault at a VAT office, where AVATAR wave typography was tested by careful readers.</div>
